states on all three tabs, both modes, no error/invented content. Explains the U29 observation: Post-Round always shows a disabled 'Finalizing Encounter Data…' button when there is no note — not stuck, but the wording reads as 'in progress' (UX copy, needs a human; EFS 'tell the physician what to do next')"},"testCase":{"id":"15c72df78b9bb1aa997b763f95e18d81","externalId":"61c77266846e08443ad2ff9c65b3869f","name":"[dev] S02 Patient with no notes yet: every chart tab in both contexts shows empty sections, no error, nothing invented","fullName":"EFS Empty & Failure States › EFS/S02"},"descriptionHtml":"<div class=\"rc-approach\"><p><b>思路 / Approach</b> · EFS Empty &amp; Failure States · <b>S02</b> 「还没有记录的病人：两个模式下病历的每个标签页都显示空的部分，没有报错，没有编造」 <span class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\" lang=\"en\">Patient with no notes yet: every chart tab in both contexts shows empty sections, no error, nothing invented</span></p><p><b>覆盖的 UAT 步骤 / 票 AC：</b></p><ul><li><b>U2</b> Patient with no notes yet: a clear empty state and no errors.（UAT EFS state 2；TFA-94745 state 2）</li><li><b>U11</b> Every state shows a clear, plain-language message in the app's existing style that tells the physician what to do next (retry, enable permission, sign in, check connection).（UAT EFS Expected Result；TFA-94745 AC 1；TFA-94745 AC 5）</li><li><b>U12</b> No state ever shows a blank screen, a crash, a raw error pop-up, or invented content.（UAT EFS intro；UAT 3.4；TFA-94745 AC 2）</li><li><b>U14</b> Every state works in both Hospital and Nursing Home, on web, iOS and Android.（UAT EFS Expected Result；UAT 3.3；TFA-94745 AC 6）</li></ul><p><b>测试设计方法：</b>主流程（happy-path） — 照 UAT / 票的原话把正常流程走一遍，该出现的都要出现。</p><p><b>Given </b>The standard fixture: one Hospital patient and one Nursing Home resident created with a name and diagnosis only; nothing dictated, no note</p><p><b>When </b>Open the Hospital patient and visit Pre-Round, Encounter and Post-Round; then the Nursing Home resident's Pre-Round, Encounter and Post-Round</p><p><b>Then </b>Every tab renders; the note area says there is no note yet and what to do; no error text, no 'undefined' / 'NaN' / 'Invalid Date'; no vital, lab or finding that was never entered</p><p><b>通过的标准（oracle，节选）：</b>From U2 and U12: each checkpoint mustContain the patient's name; the Post-Round checkpoints mustContain 'no note'; all mustNotContain error words, render-error tokens and normal-sounding findings that could only be invented ('afebrile', 'within normal limits', 'mg/dL'). Which screens count is Q7. …</p><p><b>在哪跑：</b>dev 单元 U25；测试方法 AGENT · 浏览器 agent；矩阵里排的车道 浏览器 agent（automated）</p><p><small>S02 是我们自己编的用例号（覆盖矩阵 cases/EFS.matrix.json 里的编号），不是 UAT 文档里的步骤号。</small></p></div><p><b>环境：dev</b> — dev 部署，build <code>e02167f</code>（Deploy Convex，2026-10-12T18:24:27Z）；账号和地址不写进报告；run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>。</p><p><b>测试方法：</b>AGENT · 浏览器 agent；辅助：VISUAL · 视觉（截图给人看） — 按 cases/test-methods.json 的分类，分类说在 both 跑；来源：<code>dev</code>。</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> EFS Empty &amp; Failure States · <b>Section:</b> A5 · Cross-Cutting · <b>Scenario:</b> EFS/S02</p><p><b>Patient with no notes yet: every chart tab in both contexts shows empty sections, no error, nothing invented</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-94745 Empty &amp; Failure States (ready for qa)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>units/U25.verdict.json</code>), unit U25 split by its parts' checkpoints. Agent: 97 turns, 262 s, $0.77.</p><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U25 (#25, ready-for-qa, ui-only) — Chart tabs of a patient with no notes. Same legacy seed, same chart tabs. EFS S02 and TC-16 S08 both check the 'patient with no notes yet' state (TC-16 S08 cites UAT EFS state 2) on the same Encounter tab, with different checks, so they share the setup instead of being duplicates. TC-01 S09 only moves between the same tabs. Runs together with TC-16/S08, TC-01/S09.</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #25, U25; checked: yes): <b>Pass</b> — empty states on all three tabs, both modes, no error/invented content. Explains the U29 observation: Post-Round always shows a disabled 'Finalizing Encounter Data…' button when there is no note — not stuck, but the wording reads as 'in progress' (UX copy, needs a human; EFS 'tell the physician what to do next')</p>","environment":"default","setup":[],"teardown":[],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["EFS Empty & Failure States","S02 Patient with no notes yet: every chart tab in both contexts shows empty sections, no error, nothing…"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":[],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"8e096a2ab8070189c9a6ebb08fb43b94","originalFileName":"681dac9b-9183-41ce-ae7f-f348b72fc323-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":2872,"name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"35d5dc75fe66f860ab7a91de8d9256ae","originalFileName":"9fc11b39-485f-4b58-b139-4bc18f514878-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screenshot","contentType":"image/png","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":76091},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"23f72125831a266018c6efd560b6f5af","originalFileName":"fe7c7bbf-a646-4234-827f-c7b31fcd2fd6-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":2619},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"6801728d265ba2dc67e2072dd3d381c4","originalFileName":"00caf6d7-d904-4399-86e1-7aa3b3c89969-attachment.png","ext":".png","contentType":"image/png","contentLength":53557,"name":"screenshot"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"254d64112837688fabc76b1cab633d71","originalFileName":"42e5af2f-cdba-4717-9770-9d3868202787-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":1410,"name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"c53f65a8181c